><td align="left">-1.84</td><td align="left">-1.80</td><td align="left">-1.99</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">1/2 &#x000d7; MIC</td><td align="left">0.18</td><td align="left">0.29</td><td align="left">0.91</td><td align="left">1.03</td><td align="left">1.71</td><td align="left">2.31</td><td align="left">3.49</td><td align="left">3.41</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">1/4 &#x000d7; MIC</td><td align="left">0.39</td><td align="left">0.36</td><td align="left">1.38</td><td align="left">1.63</td><td align="left">2.23</td><td align="left">2.53</td><td align="left">4.58</td><td align="left">4.28</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">ELF</td><td align="left">-0.45</td><td align="left">-1.22</td><td align="left">-2.40</td><td align="left">-2.12</td><td align="left">-2.72</td><td align="left">-2.55</td><td align="left">&#x0003e; -3.0</td><td align="left">&#x0003e; -3.0</td></tr><tr><td align="left"><italic>Control</italic></td><td></td><td align="left">0.64</td><td align="left">0.38</td><td align="left">1.96</td><td align="left">1.95</td><td align="left">4.32</td><td align="left">3.05</td><td align="left">5.44</td><td align="left">4.90</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T4"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>Time kill curve against &#x003b2;-lactamase positive <italic>H. influenzae </italic>(n = 50)</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="left"><bold>Antibiotic</bold></td><td></td><td align="center" colspan="8"><bold>Changes in colony counts vs initial inocula after</bold></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td colspan="8"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td align="center" colspan="2">3 h</td><td align="center" colspan="2">6 h</td><td align="center" colspan="2">12 h</td><td align="center" colspan="2">24 h</td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td colspan="8"><hr></hr></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td align="left">CO<sub>2</sub></td><td align="left">Air</td><td align="left">CO<sub>2</sub></td><td a